 the new. Designed by globally acclaimed architects, Orise is a beacon of sophistication, boasting panoramic views of Dubai’s skyline and the Creekside, creating an idyllic setting for refined living.This exclusive development features a variety of residences, including 1 to 3-bedroom apartments, chalets, and duplex penthouses, catering to diverse lifestyles and preferences. With innovative floorplans and personalized interior options, Orise offers homes designed for comfort, elegance, and functionality. Set amidst lush private gardens and complemented by resort-style amenities, Orise is more than just a residence—it’s a lifestyle destination that inspires and elevates modern waterfront living","price":1900000,"title":"Orise","bitrix":{"id":1061,"pf_id":"are.2.14721","source":null,"project_id":"Orise","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Orise by Beyond","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"BEYOND","project_location":"Maritime City"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/feat_105df35fca.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/feat_105df35fca.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.0153298,"lng":55.4540561},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/2_ce86b1283e.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/2_ce86b1283e.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/4_f884dba5f7.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/4_f884dba5f7.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/1_75396e3b03.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/1_75396e3b03.webp"}],"images2":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/feat_105df35fca.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/feat_105df35fca.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/2_ce86b1283e.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.ne